  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_8135.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La penya Desbordats ha demostrado este mi&eacute;rcoles por la noche en la Fira d&#39;Onda que van m&aacute;s all&aacute; de la m&uacute;sica y los toros, y han organizado en su casal el recital Palabras que se dej&oacute; el viento, con poemas de Javi Aguilella y m&uacute;sica Luis Mu&ntilde;oz y H&eacute;ctor Madue&ntilde;o Pallar&eacute;s.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8134.jpg\" alt=\"img_8134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8135.jpg\" alt=\"img_8135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8136.jpg\" alt=\"img_8136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8137.jpg\" alt=\"img_8137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8138.jpg\" alt=\"img_8138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8139.jpg\" alt=\"img_8139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8140.jpg\" alt=\"img_8140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recitaljaviaguilelladesbordatsfira13/img_8141.jpg\" alt=\"img_8141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91